      "required": [
        "prop",
        "keys"
      ],
      "description": "Adds or replaces keys on one property of an item (or of each of `items`). `t` is item time\nand `at` sequence time; both snap to frames (`fine`: audio samples, for audio properties).\nA key's `easing` (or `interp`) shapes the move to the next key; a new key inherits the one\nbefore it, else linear (hold for flips). A static property becomes animated with exactly\nthese keys; a key at an occupied time replaces that key; `replace: true` makes the result\nexactly these keys. Omit `value` to key the current value. Values outside the property's\nrange are `Invalid`; `Locked` if the item's track is locked.",
      "title": "KeyframeSet"
    },
